#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""PatchProof — single-file project launcher.

This file contains the complete PatchProof React + Vite + Flask project as an
embedded, integrity-checked ZIP payload. On first run it safely extracts that
project into a neighbouring ``PatchProof`` directory, prepares the Python
virtual environment and npm dependencies, then launches Flask and Vite.

Requirements:
  * Python 3.10+
  * Node.js 22.12+ and npm (required for the React/Vite interface)
  * Internet access on first run to install Python/npm dependencies

Run:
  py PatchProof.py

Useful options:
  py PatchProof.py --extract-only       Extract the project, do not start it
  py PatchProof.py --backend-only       Start Flask without Vite
  py PatchProof.py --skip-install       Do not install Python/npm dependencies
  py PatchProof.py --no-browser         Do not open the browser automatically
  py PatchProof.py --project-dir PATH   Extract/use a chosen project directory
  py PatchProof.py --force-extract      Refresh files in an already extracted project

The source package is extracted as ordinary editable files. The original
uploaded Python source remains in PatchProof/backup/V9_fixed.py unchanged.
"""
